/// strings_legacy -- opt-in, deprecated aliases for interfaces removed from
/// current POSIX `<strings.h>`.
///
/// SPEC.md Section 16.3 and Appendix A.6: bcmp, bcopy, bzero, index, rindex
/// (legacy in Issue 6, removed in Issue 7). Available only for migration:
